{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":84503,"Title":"liked a post you made in 2016 Wedding At Cancun Mexi...","Message":"Hello!\n\nemmapalmer just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi all brides to be! I am very excited that I am going to have a destination wedding.  I just love the beach at Cancun after the visit last summer. Ocean water is just unreal...it's the most beautiful beach I've seen so far.  As you all know, planning is a long and tedious process...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79063-2016-wedding-at-cancun-mexico-need-opinions-on-the-resorts\/?view=findpost&p=1893098\n","Sender":{"Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430425818,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":84500,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that emmapalmer mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79063-2016-wedding-at-cancun-mexico-need-opinions-on-the-resorts\/?view=findpost&p=1894971\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"kuoling\" . Giving my +1 for Iberostar.\n\nI had guests that stayed and would not stop bragging about how beautiful the resort was.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1430425789,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":79675,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"kuoling,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome kuoling to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello kuoling,\n\nWelcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.    \n\nHere are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.     \n\n  If you have not done so, you may want to:     \ncomplete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)\nvisit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself  \nStart your own wedding planning blog  \nfind the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in\n \n  Here are some links that may be helpful to you:     \nDestination Wedding Community & Forum  \nResort Reviews  \nWedding Vendor Reviews  \nDestination Wedding Tips and Articles  \nWedding Image Gallery  \nBDW Help Page  \nBDW Forum Rules and Etiquette  \nHow to Download Attachments  \n \n  Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:     \n\nModerators and Community Leaders     \nTammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW  .  Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006\nAlexisinJamaica   - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.\n \nIf you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:   \nBDW on Facebook   \nBDW on Twitter   \nBDW on Pinterest   \n \n  If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,   please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com .   \n\n Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!      \n\nPlease feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.    \n\nTeam BDW    \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=9356#msg17130\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1428959859,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":9356}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"3","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
