ick\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/image.lafemmebonita.com\/c\/a741121.png\">http:\/\/image.lafemmebonita.com\/c\/a741121.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"aimless911@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1204133967,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208670.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Aimless911","Id":208670,"Name":"Aimless911","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12263,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7bf3a335dd42745bbc28fefb00c9be2","RawContent":"I&#039;ve been using &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.ezweddingplanner.com\"&gt;Wedding Planner - Free online planning software&lt;\/a&gt;. It looks like it&#039;s straight outta the &#039;80s, but I love the &amp;quot;People&amp;quot; feature and the &amp;quot;Seating&amp;quot; one too. I don&#039;t really use it for much else, as it&#039;s not highly customizeable (sp?) but you can change SOME things.","Attachments":[],"Id":215025,"PostDate":1204597493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've been using <a href='http:\/\/www.ezweddingplanner.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Planner - Free online planning software<\/a>. It looks like it's straight outta the '80s, but I love the \"People\" feature and the \"Seating\" one too. I don't really use it for much else, as it's not highly customizeable (sp?) but you can change SOME things.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abbie.chalcraft@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.147.88.43","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1194486840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207912.jpg?_r=1386394469","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":162,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Abbie","Id":207912,"Name":"Abbie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12263,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57d548dd84dee16b023b9ae0995402ba","RawContent":"I used the one from Sandals.com. I really like it and it&#039;s free. I think it would be great for what you want cause you can set up different events. \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.sandals.com\/general\/planner.cfm\"&gt;Wedding Planner Software&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":270119,"PostDate":1208386211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I used the one from Sandals.com. I really like it and it's free. I think it would be great for what you want cause you can set up different events. <br