mp;nbsp; The dress is Ivory and size 12, never altered, never worn.&amp;nbsp; If you have any questions please ask.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also purchased a slip and beautiful veil, both never used if you would like to purchase those as well, we can decide a price on those seperate or as a package&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am located in Richmond, VA if this is something you want to try on or purchase in person&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Paid $500 for the gown and never got married, the dress is BEAUTIFUL and only taken out of the garment bag for pictures.&amp;nbsp; Asking $300 for the dress or best offer (dress is still currently selling for $500 in stores)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You can see it is still selling at David&#039;s Bridal and the reviews are awesome:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/Product_Chiffon-A-line-Gown-with-Side-Draped-Bodice-V9409\"&gt;http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/Product_Chiffon-A-line-Gown-with-Side-Draped-Bodice-V9409&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588619,"PostDate":1330554525,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Chiffon A-line\u00a0gown with side draped bodice, beaded lace, and lace up back.\u00a0 Sweep train.\u00a0 The dress is Ivory and size 12, never altered, never worn.\u00a0 If you have any questions please ask.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also purchased a slip and beautiful veil, both ne