{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":16,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":995,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1895364,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1430839315,"LastPoster":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":98,"Preview":{"Id":1895364,"PostDate":1430839315,"PostContent":"Hello ladies, I purchased a Essense of Australia gown back in October. When I purchased it I was...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79150,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92efd4ac7db99b064dd0597f3a590279","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies,\n\n\nI purchased a Essense of Australia gown back in October. When I purchased it I was a bit excited and just purchased the last one they had since I had gotten a good deal on the dress. The dress is new and worth $1900.00 new. It is a current style that is still active and shown on the Essense website (Design D1562).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t have the sash that is shown in the photo. It was extra and I didn&#039;t purchase it as I didn&#039;t love the colour of it. The dress is a stunning organza mermaid with lace detail\/overlay. It has a sweetheart neckline with an illusion neckline as well. The back of the dress has beautiful fabric covered buttons. Lots of stunning detail to this dress (which is what I loved about it so much)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is a size 8, but the designer says it fits a street size 4. I am selling it because i&#039;m a street size 8 and the dress simply doesn&#039;t fit me.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m selling it for $750 + shipping (unless local - Toronto area).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895364,"PostDate":1430839315,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies,<br><br>\nI purchased a Essense of Australia gown back in October. When I purchased it I was a bit excited and just purchased the last one they had since I had gotten a good deal on the dress. The dress is new and worth $1900.00 new. It is a current style that is still active and shown on the Essense website (Design D1562).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I don't have the sash that is shown in the photo. It was extra and I didn't purchase it as I didn't love the colour of it. The dress is a stunning organza mermaid with lace detail\/overlay. It has a sweetheart neckline with an illusion neckline as well. The back of the dress has beautiful fabric covered buttons. Lots of stunning detail to this dress (which is what I loved about it so much)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is a size 8, but the designer says it fits a street size 4. I am selling it because i'm a street size 8 and the dress simply doesn't fit me.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm selling it for $750 + shipping (unless local - Toronto area).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895364]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281478-0-61185900-1430835628.jpg\" title=\"post-281478-0-56878000-1426452030.jpg - Size: 168.87KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281478-0-61185900-1430835628.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"post-281478-0-56878000-1426452030.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895364]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281478-0-67026700-1430835698.jpg\" title=\"post-281478-0-65891400-1426452021.jpg - Size: 159.67KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281478-0-67026700-1430835698.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"post-281478-0-65891400-1426452021.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1895364]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281478-0-36313600-1430835704.jpg\" title=\"post-281478-0-73333200-1426452006.jpg - Size: 160.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2015\/post-281478-0-36313600-1430835704.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"post-281478-0-73333200-1426452006.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419441414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"Formatt